## Common errors

| What you see | Likely cause |
|---|---|
| `undefined` on screen | prop name misspelled — check spelling on both sides |
| `"205"` instead of `25` | number sent in quotes instead of braces |
| Nothing renders | forgot to `export default` the component |
| Same content in every card | you used the component but sent no props |

